<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bonds end firm, government tender favoured.</title>
<headline>Swiss bonds end firm, government tender favoured.</headline>
<text>
<p>1635 GMT - Swiss long-dated bond futures were mostly firmer at the close, with traders seeing a good response to the Swiss government's tender, reopening its outstanding June 2007 bond. * March Conf contract ends 16 basis points higher at 117.04 * Cash 4-1/2 pct June 2007 bond yields 3.87 pct vs 3.868</p>
</text>
